title: Agricultural Policy
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: agricultural_policy_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: dvp_in_government = 1 and agriculture_minister_party = dvp_name and agricultural_policy_timer == 0
card-image: img/portraits/KanitzGerhard.jpg
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
#subtitle: Issues of farmer financing, grain purchasing, and land reform.

= Agricultural Policy

While agricultural policy has historically not been the domain of the <span style="color: var(--dvp-color);">**[+ dvp_name +]**</span>, there is much need for policy in this area. Our urban constituencies hope for cheaper and more stable food supplies, while small farmers need economic relief. There is also the movement for land reform, to break up the large aristocratic estates and redistribute land to peasants.

- @land_reform
- @agricultural_finance
- @pro_consumer
- @state_buyer
- @root: Do not enact any policies for now.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@land_reform
title: Land Reform
subtitle: -1 budget - Break up the large aristocratic estates and give land to landless workers.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if budget <= 0 : Requires 1 budget. ?] [? if judicial_reform < 2 : The judiciary would never allow this. ?]
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2 and budget > 0
on-arrival: budget -= 1; land_reform += 1; coalition_dissent += 1 if not in_weimar_coalition; dvp_land_reform = 1; rural_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nsdap -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 1 if unemployed >= 5; spd_relation += 5; dbp_relation += 5; dnvp_relation -= 4; kvp_relation -= 4; cnblp_relation -= 7; progressive_strength += 5; progressive_dissent -= 5; rural_sol += 3; rural_policy += 1; hindenburg_angry += 10;
max-visits: 4

With our policy of land reform, we are acquiring farmland from large estates, and giving the land to farmworkers' associations and small peasants. In essence, this brings class struggle to the countryside, breaking the semi-feudal property relations present in East Prussia and other areas with large estates. The right wing parties and large farmers despise our intrusion into the sacredness of private property, while leftists are cautiously optimistic.


@agricultural_finance
title: Agricultural Financing
subtitle: -1 budget - Increase financing for agricultural credit and insurance.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; agricultural_finance += 1; dvp_agricultural_finance = 1; rural_dvp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_nsdap -= 3*(1-dissent); center_dissent += 5; left_dissent += 4; rural_sol += 4; rural_policy += 1; economic_growth += 0.2; dbp_relation += 3

We have increased financial support for small farmers, providing access to credit and insurance, saving them from privation.


@pro_consumer
title: Food Procurement
subtitle: -1 budget - Provide inexpensive food for workers.
choose-if: budget >= 1
on-arrival: budget -= 1; pro_consumer += 1; workers_dvp += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_dvp += 4*(1-dissent); workers_sol += 4; coalition_dissent += 1 if black_thursday_seen; economic_growth += 0.2;

We have increased state purchasing of food staples to provide to urban workers and the poor. This benefits workers more than it benefits farmers, as we are negotiating for lower purchase prices.
